---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Privacy Policy — TipSplit" 
    description="Your privacy matters. Learn how TipSplit processes your calculations locally in your browser with zero data collection."
>
    <main class="app-container relative z-10 max-w-(--max-width) mx-auto px-4 py-6 sm:px-6 sm:py-10 pb-12">
        <!-- Back Link -->
        <a href="/" class="back-link">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M10 13L5 8l5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
            Back to Calculator
        </a>

        <!-- Content Card -->
        <section class="card static-card bg-bg-card border border-border rounded-lg p-6 sm:p-8 static-content">
            <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p>Last updated: August 11, 2026</p>
            
            <p>At TipSplit, we believe your financial data and team details are your business. This privacy policy describes how we handle information on our website.</p>

            <h2>1. Zero Server-Side Data Collection</h2>
            <p>TipSplit is designed as a client-side utility. All computations, calculations, and inputs are processed locally in your web browser. <strong>We do not collect, store, or transmit any data</strong> you enter into the calculator—including total tips, team member names, hours worked, role points, or calculated distributions—to any server.</p>

            <h2>2. Local Browser Storage & Data Persistence</h2>
            <p>We use local browser storage (such as <code>localStorage</code> and <code>sessionStorage</code>) to power features that improve your day-to-day workflow. Specifically:</p>
            <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                <li><strong>Active State Preservation:</strong> Remembers your inputs and current team list to prevent data loss when navigating or selecting a new location.</li>
                <li><strong>Shift History Log:</strong> If you choose to use the "Save Shift" feature, the complete results and staff names for that shift are logged locally in your browser.</li>
                <li><strong>Roster Templates:</strong> If you use the "Save Roster Template" feature, the list of team member names and roles is stored on your device so you can reload it instantly.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>All of this data is stored 100% locally on your own machine. We do not transfer, compile, or back up any of this information to our servers or third parties. You can clear all saved data at any time by clearing your browser's cache/cookies or using the delete actions within the app.</p>

            <h2>3. No Third-Party Advertising or Data Selling</h2>
            <p>TipSplit is a 100% ad-free, sponsor-free, and tracker-free tool. We do not use Google AdSense, third-party advertising networks, or commercial retargeting cookies. We do not track your behavior across the web, and we never monetize by selling or sharing your inputs, names, or tip figures. All calculation data remains strictly local to your browser.</p>

            <h2>4. Third-Party Hosting</h2>
            <p>This website is hosted on static hosting services. The hosting provider may log basic technical requests (like IP addresses, browser user-agents, and requesting URLs) to ensure security and monitor server health. These logs are managed by the host and are not connected to your calculator inputs.</p>

            <h2>5. Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date. Since we do not collect user contact information, we encourage you to review this page periodically.</p>

            <h2>6. Contact Us</h2>
            <p>If you have any questions or feedback about our privacy practices, please visit our <a href="/contact" class="text-accent hover:underline">Contact Us</a> page.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <footer class="footer text-center mt-8 pt-5">
            <nav class="footer-links flex items-center justify-center gap-4 text-[0.75rem] font-medium text-text-secondary mb-3.5" aria-label="Footer Navigation">
                <a href="/about" class="hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-150 no-underline">About Us</a>
                <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-border/50" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-150 no-underline">Privacy Policy</a>
                <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-border/50" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <a href="/terms" class="hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-150 no-underline">Terms & Conditions</a>
                <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-border/50" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <a href="/contact" class="hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-150 no-underline">Contact Us</a>
            </nav>
            <p class="text-text-muted text-[0.78rem] mb-3">TipSplit · 100% Free & Private Calculator</p>
        </footer>
    </main>
</Layout>
